  "an4.146:0.3": "6. Paṭhamakālasuttaṃ ",
  "an4.146:1.1": "‘‘Cattārome, bhikkhave, kālā. ",
  "an4.146:1.2": "Katame cattāro? ",
  "an4.146:1.3": "Kālena dhammassavanaṃ, kālena dhammasākacchā, kālena sammasanā , kālena vipassanā – ",
  "an4.146:1.4": "ime kho, bhikkhave, cattāro kālā’’ti. ",
  "an4.146:1.5": "Chaṭṭhaṃ. "
}
